 she answers the helm","comment":"Your ruling of 13 October 2026: steer her yourself in the 3D view. As first made: with no way on her the rudder bites at three tenths of her rate of turn, at full speed all of it; and as far over as the helm is.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"403e8e54-3098-45a0-9d7a-e0400d9fc2c7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":320.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":450.0},"title":"What the game gives","body":"Her rate of turn: her class''s, degrees a second at speed 1 (ChartBody.turnRate, 40). Her way: her speed made good as a share of her full speed, 0 to 1. The helm over: -1 hard to port, 1 hard to starboard, 0 amidships (then the answer is 0: she holds her heading).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"979e8bcf-ff26-4a28-82bf-6c7d35d6eb32","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
